  "memo": "Recommend clear. R08 holds because three accounts used the shipping address, but the current home address has been registered for 332.74894675925924 days, so §6.4(b) excludes it from the family count. No other rule holds; no adverse family remains. No earlier outcome settles the order, and no completed check changes the result. Household sharing is the strongest benign explanation; takeover lacks supporting access signals. The failed unpaid installment is repayment context, not evidence of fraudulent intent. Under §6.6(c), clear is the only permitted disposition. No verification check is needed."
